      "name": "studio_get_state",
      "description": "Read bounded connection, document, controller-predicate, and Play-transition state from one explicitly targeted Studio session. available_datamodel_types lists only general-operation request channels that are actually routable through v2; the lifecycle-only PlayServer bridge is never reported as a Server or Client route.",
